1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,850
You followed me.

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,630
You took the long way.

3
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:05,480
That's not an answer.

4
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:07,580
Nobody comes out here.

5
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:08,660
You did.

6
00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:10,160
Your spot.

7
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:11,740
Twelve years.

8
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:14,640
Of sitting here after the late shift.

9
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:15,820
Alone.

10
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:17,520
With the fire.

11
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:19,800
So it's not my clearing.

12
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:21,300
It's nobody's.

13
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:25,280
This is my clearing. You can share it.
